  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "FIX LFM2 (and any add_bos_token=true ChatML model) degenerate chat output: the ChatML prompt path never prepended the model's BOS, so LFM2's required <|startoftext|> (id 1) was dropped, putting the model off its training distribution (coherent for a token or two, then garbage). ChatTemplates.BuildChatPrompt now honors the GGUF's tokenizer.ggml.add_bos_token on the ChatML path (qwen2.5/qwen3 stay BOS-less; unaffected). Verified: LFM2 answers coherently. Also carries preview.14: three new GGUF LLM architectures qwen3, LFM2, and qwen3.5 (Qwen3-Next). qwen3 adds the useRMSNorm path (standard transformer). LFM2 is a ShortConv hybrid with a conv-state cache for O(1) KV-decode. qwen3.5 (GGUF arch qwen35) is Gated DeltaNet linear-attention (24 layers) + gated full-attention (8 layers): the GatedDeltaNet op is bit-exact to an independent numpy reference and the full model predicts \" Paris\" for \"The capital of France is\" (residual bit-exact through 4 layers on CUDA). qwen3 + LFM2 are verified end-to-end on WebGPU + WebGL + CUDA + OpenCL. Carries preview.13 (SD-Turbo VAE full-res GPU-resident). Full changelog: https://github.com/LostBeard/SpawnDev.ILGPU.ML/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
